<title>USA: Vanguard names Robert Spane CEO.</title>
<headline>Vanguard names Robert Spane CEO.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vanguard Airlines Inc said Friday that John Tague had resigned as chairman, chief executive and president, effective June 15, and would be succeeded by Robert Spane.</p>
<p>Spane currently is a Vanguard director.</p>
</text>
